        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Rock%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the 1957 desegregation crisis, Little Rock Central High School became the flashpoint of the Civil Rights movement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        14,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
